  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3509.02 Applicability and Scope. This section applies to preneed insurance contracts, as defined in Ins 3509.03, and to similar policies and certificates.\n\nSource. #9245, eff 9-2-08; ss by #11148, eff 9-2-16",
